File name: MARBLOOP.MP
Path description: Marble passages level 2 loop
Path starts: Marble passage
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 4
Level recommendation: 20-30
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: Unsure.
Additional information:

Priests do very well on this loop, because the monsters are all undead,
so they can use spells like Disrupt which are high damage for low mana
use, but only work on undead.

Included in the zip are MARBTOMB.MP and TOMBMARB.MP which are paths
to and from the start of this loop.
